---
/**
 * 首页（英文）—— /en/
 *
 * 语气参照 docs/l10n-guide.md 的语气表：克制、口语、不用力。
 *   算了 → Never mind（不是 Cancel）
 *   挂着 → Stay open（不是 Keep Alive）
 * 禁止：感叹号、Title Case（按钮除外）、Powerful / Seamless 这类词。
 *
 * ⚠️ 只有首页有英文版。隐私 / 条款 / 支持 是 App Store 审核员看过的
 * 中文法律文本，一个字都不能改 —— 也不该由实现者擅自上线一份
 * 未经法务审阅的英文译本。页脚链接已标注 (中文)。
 * 若产品方需要英文法律文本，那是一次单独的、需要审阅的工作。
 */
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Hearth from '../../components/Hearth.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Lares Circle — an always-on voice room for people you already know"
  description="An always-on voice room for a small circle of people you already know. Walk in and talk, or just stay open without saying anything, like sitting around a fire. Open source, self-hosted, end-to-end encryption optional."
  lang="en"
  altHref="/"
>
  {/* 结构与中文首页一致 —— 两栏 hero，≥60rem 才分栏。见 global.css 的 .hero。 */}
  <section class="hero hero--split">
    <div>
      <p class="hero__eyebrow">
        The household fire spirit, and it travels with you.
      </p>

      <h1 class="hero__title">
        Lares Circle
        <span class="hero__alt" lang="zh-Hans">炉灵</span>
      </h1>

      {/*
        英文版的唯一暖色落在 "fire" 上，与中文版的「火」对应。
        每个页面各自只有一处 —— 同一个位置的两种语言，不是两处。
        那圈光晕是这个词自己发的（currentColor），不是第二个颜色。
      */}
      <p class="hero__lede">
        An <strong>always-on voice room</strong> for a small circle of people you
        already know. Walk in and talk, or just stay open without saying
        anything, like sitting around a <span class="ember">fire</span>.
      </p>

      <p class="badge">In TestFlight, not on the App Store yet</p>

      <p class="hero__meta">iOS, Android, Windows, macOS and Web.</p>
    </div>

    {/* 与中文版同一个示意图组件。真机截图待 TestFlight 装上后补。 */}
    <Hearth
      caption="A diagram: the fire sits in the middle, people sit around it."
      alt="Diagram: a round room with a fire at the centre, member avatars seated in two rings around it, and a microphone plus two smaller controls at the bottom."
    />
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="what">
    <h2 id="what">What it is</h2>

    <ul class="cards">
      <li class="card">
        <h3>Always on</h3>
        <p>Not a call you start. A room that is already there.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card">
        <h3>Small circles</h3>
        <p>
          You get in with the circle passphrase. No stranger discovery, no
          random matching, no public room list.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="card">
        <h3>Encryption, if you want it</h3>
        <p>
          A circle can turn on end-to-end encryption. The key comes from the
          passphrase, so the server cannot read anything either.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="not">
    <h2 id="not">What it is not</h2>
    <blockquote class="statement">
      <p>
        Not a place to meet strangers, and not anonymous chat. There is no
        “people nearby”, no random pairing. That code does not exist in the
        repository.
      </p>
    </blockquote>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="oss">
    <h2 id="oss">Open source, self-hosted</h2>
    <p>
      The server lives in <a href="https://github.com/LFM097384/Lares"
        >the same repository</a
      >, so you can run it on your own machine and point the app at your own
      address.
    </p>
    <p>
      No sign-up, no phone number, no email. No analytics, ads or crash
      reporting SDKs. The <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a> (in Chinese) says
      so, and this site holds to it as well: no fonts, no third-party requests.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
